# Read AGENTS.md first

At the start of every session — before editing the wiki, making design decisions,
or implementing features — **read** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) in full.

It is the operating manual for this repository:

- LLM wiki layout (`raw/` immutable, `wiki/` agent-owned, `AGENTS.md` schema)
- Ingest / query / lint workflows and `log.md` format
- Domain rules: separate GFN input path from MobiFlight/SimConnect path; fail-fast on blocked platforms
- Archify diagrams live under `wiki/diagrams/`

Do not invent wiki structure or skip bookkeeping (`index.md`, `log.md`) that AGENTS.md requires.
